{
  "recipe": "turboderp-4.05",
  "model_type": "qwen4_exp",
  "about": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on turboderp/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-exl3 4.05bpw (exllamav3 1.4.4, mul1, L266): routed experts EXL3 K4 split gate / up, dense Linears and the shared expert K6, the QSA indexer K4, byte copies of the pack. Everything else as U-e4-d5, from the HF BF16 checkpoint: lm_head BF16 (the pack's K6 head is not read -- the lane builds its MXFP8 head and the MTP draft head from bf16 rows), PLE key/value MXFP8 (the pack leaves them F16), the GR low-rank + DeltaNet a/b MXFP8, norms / router / gates / embed BF16 (the pack's F16 copies are not read), the n-gram rows from the HF table (ple_rows). MTP omitted. Pass --exl3 <the pack>.",
